Sval: Remove UITour

UITour let pages on Mozilla's sites open Firefox's menus, highlight its
buttons and show tour panels. Sval granted no site the permission it
needs and locked it off. The component goes, with its actor, its panels'
markup, styles and string, its prefs and default permissions, and its
tests. The Heartbeat survey's browser.uitour.surveyDuration pref stays:
Normandy reads it.

